  "notes": "Repaired 1.6.4 final QA package; no additional feature release. Corrects cumulative UI access to private chat/artifact state, the actual poster pencil-button target, dirty-editor navigation and failed-save handling, attachment context across fast-to-full chat retries, premature attachment sends, and repeated Live preview reloads. Preserves the cumulative sidebar/projects/history, AI Search, local file extraction, faster multi-source research, voice, Stop, Chat/Live, updater, preview, and exports. Tested with the installed 1.5.9 resources in an isolated staging copy. Image attachments are previewable, but pixel-level image understanding is not supported. Hardware voice/Live and external services still require testing on the installed app.",
